{
  "file_id": "3559",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 107,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "I wonder if Kari's recovered\nfrom her cold.",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7384,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "¿Se habrá curado Kari del\nresfriado?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "On top of that, Kari remembers\nwhat happened four years ago...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7430,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "Y encima, Kari recuerda lo\nque pasó hace cuatro años..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Kari couldn't possibly be the\neighth child, could she?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7495,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "No puede ser que Kari sea el\noctavo Niño Elegido, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Let's hurry up and go see Kari.",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7552,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Venga, vamos a ver a Kari."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "...Yeah.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7586,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "...Sí."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "By the way, Koromon, there's\nsomething I need to tell you.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7595,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "Por cierto, Koromon, tengo que\ndecirte una cosa."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "What is it, Tai?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7654,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¿Qué pasa, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "From now on, you're a doll. I\nmean, you have to pretend to be a\ndoll!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7674,
      "_bytes": 69,
      "translation": "Desde ahora eres un muñeco.\n¡Bueno, finge ser un muñeco!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "A doll...?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7744,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¿Muñeco...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Uh, I mean... you can't talk, and\nyou can't move around in front of\npeople!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7755,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "¡Bueno, digo... no puedes hablar,\nni moverte delante de la gente!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Got it! I'm a doll, I'm a doll!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7831,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Vale! ¡Soy un muñeco, un muñeco!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "I'm worried...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7863,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "Me preocupa..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Hm? Is that your house, Tai?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7878,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¿Es esa tu casa, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "No, mine's on the other side... I\ngot a little too nervous.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7910,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "No, la mía está al otro lado...\nMe puse un poco nervioso."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7970,
      "_bytes": 1,
      "translation": "?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "I mean, it's *my* house, but...\nwell, let's go!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7972,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "¡Bueno, sí que es mi casa,\npero... vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Wow, Tai, your house is big!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8020,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Vaya, Tai, tu casa es enorme!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "No, no, my house isn't the\nwhole... well, whatever.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8052,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "No, no, mi casa no es todo\neso... bueno, da igual."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "(This is the second time we're\ncome back here, but...)",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8104,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "(Es la segunda vez que\nvolvemos aquí, pero...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "(I wonder if Kari and Mom and\nDad are here, like they should\nbe...)",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8159,
      "_bytes": 69,
      "translation": "(Me pregunto si Kari, mamá y\npapá estarán aquí, como\ndeberían...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "(Why am I so worried about this?)",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8229,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "(¿Por qué me preocupa tanto?)"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Ah, Tai, are you back from\nsummer camp?",
      "speaker_id": 6391,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8263,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "Ah, Tai, ¿ya has vuelto del\ncampamento?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Y-yeah! They sent us home early\nbecause of abnormal weather, you\nknow.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8306,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "¡S-sí! Nos mandaron a casa antes\npor culpa del tiempo tan raro."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Speaking of which, the news said\nthat there was a sudden snowstorm.",
      "speaker_id": 6391,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8377,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "Por cierto, las noticias\ndijeron que hubo una ventisca\nde repente."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "A snowstorm!? Was it Frigimon!?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8445,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¿¡Una ventisca!? ¿¡Sería Frigimon!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Aaaack! Y-you idiot!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8480,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Aaay! ¡I-idiota!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Hey, Tai! Ah! What are you\ndoing!? *mfffghghhhgg*",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8501,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "¡Oye, Tai! ¡Ah! ¿¡Qué haces!?\nMfffghghhhgg"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "I keep telling you not to move!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8554,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Que no te muevas, te digo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "...?",
      "speaker_id": 6391,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8586,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Was that... a doll, just now?",
      "speaker_id": 6391,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8591,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¿Eso ha sido... un muñeco?"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Isn't it amazing? It records stuff\nand plays it back.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8621,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "Increíble, ¿no? Graba cosas\ny las reproduce."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "It's a souvenir for Kari.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8675,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Es un recuerdo para Kari."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Ah, for Kari.",
      "speaker_id": 6391,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8703,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "Ah, para Kari."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Yeah, it's impossible for a doll\nto talk...",
      "speaker_id": 6391,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8719,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "Ya, es imposible que un\nmuñeco hable..."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Yeah, yeah! Ahahaha...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8763,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡Ya, ya! Jajaja..."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "It's hoooooot. It's been so hot\nlately...",
      "speaker_id": 6381,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8786,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "Qué calooor. Hace tanto\ncalor últimamente..."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "I mean, it's summer, isn't it?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8828,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Bueno, es verano, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Yeah, but it's way too hot, more\nso than usual.",
      "speaker_id": 6381,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8859,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "Ya, pero hace muchísimo más\ncalor de lo normal."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Hot!? Is it because of Meramon?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8907,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¿¡Calor!? ¿Será por Meramon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Agh, you idiot! Be quiet!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8939,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Ay, idiota! ¡Cállate!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "*mffffghghf*",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8965,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Mffffghghf"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Hm?",
      "speaker_id": 6381,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8978,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "¿Eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Did that doll just... move?",
      "speaker_id": 6381,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8982,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¿Se ha movido... el muñeco?"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9010,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 6381,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9014,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "It couldn't have. Of course not...",
      "speaker_id": 6381,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9018,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "No puede ser. Claro que no..."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Hahaha...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9053,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Jajaja..."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Seriously, though, it's getting\nway too hot. I could have sworn\nI'd just seen a doll moving...",
      "speaker_id": 6381,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9063,
      "_bytes": 94,
      "translation": "En serio, hace demasiado\ncalor. Juraría que acabo de\nver moverse a un muñeco..."
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "*whew*",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9158,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "Uf..."
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Ah, Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 6371,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9165,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Ah, Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Hey, what's going on?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9177,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Oye, ¿qué pasa aquí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "The weather's been kind of\nstrange, hasn't it? It gets hot,\nand then suddenly it gets cold...",
      "speaker_id": 6371,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9199,
      "_bytes": 93,
      "translation": "El tiempo está muy raro,\n¿no? Hace calor y de repente\nse pone frío..."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "I know, right? I just got back\nfrom summer camp... because there\nwas a snowstorm.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9293,
      "_bytes": 81,
      "translation": "Ya ves. Acabo de volver del\ncampamento... por una\nventisca."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "That's really bad!",
      "speaker_id": 6371,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9375,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Eso es muy grave!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Why?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9394,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¿Por?"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "I have to observe morning glories\nfor school! They're going to wilt!",
      "speaker_id": 6371,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9399,
      "_bytes": 68,
      "translation": "¡Tengo que vigilar las\ncampanillas del cole! ¡Se van\na marchitar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "This is a real problem!",
      "speaker_id": 6371,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9468,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Esto sí que es un lío!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "A problem!? Like a Digimon?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9492,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¿¡Un lío!? ¿Como un Digimon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Aaaaargh! I told you not to talk!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9520,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Aaaargh! ¡Que no hables, te dije!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "The doll! It talked!",
      "speaker_id": 6371,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9554,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡El muñeco habló!"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "No, you're wrong.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9575,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "No, te equivocas."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "What am I wrong about?",
      "speaker_id": 6371,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9593,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¿En qué me equivoco?"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "WE ARE EARTHLINGS... see, *I've*\nbeen talking.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9616,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "SOMOS TERRÍCOLAS... mira,\nhablaba yo."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Hmm, are you sure about that?\nWell, whatever!",
      "speaker_id": 6371,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9663,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Mmm, ¿seguro que es así?\n¡Bueno, da igual!"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "I haven't been able to catch any\nbugs lately.",
      "speaker_id": 6361,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9709,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "No he podido cazar ningún\nbicho últimamente."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "No dragonflies or grasshoppers or\nstag beetles...",
      "speaker_id": 6361,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9755,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "Ni libélulas, saltamontes,\nni ciervos volantes..."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Stag beetles!? Like Kuwagamon?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9805,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¿¡Ciervos volantes!? ¿Kuwagamon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Agh, I told you not to talk!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9836,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Ay, que no hables, te dije!"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "...or rhinoceros beetles or\nwalking sticks or drone beetles...",
      "speaker_id": 6361,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9865,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "...ni escarabajos rinoceronte,\ninsectos palo, ni abejorros..."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "(Thank goodness. Seems like he\ndidn't hear.)",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9928,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "(Menos mal. Parece que no\nlo ha oído.)"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "I'm home!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9973,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Ya estoy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Tai? What happened? Weren't you\nat camp?",
      "speaker_id": 6101,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9983,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¿Tai? ¿Qué pasó? ¿No estabas\nde campamento?"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Y-yeah! They cancelled it because\nof the snow.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10027,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¡S-sí! Lo cancelaron por\nla nieve."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Snow? What's been going on with\nall this weird weather lately...\nand what's that?",
      "speaker_id": 6101,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10074,
      "_bytes": 81,
      "translation": "¿Nieve? ¿Qué está pasando con\neste tiempo tan raro...\ny eso qué es?"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Oh, this? It's a souvenir for\nKari.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10156,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Ah, ¿esto? Es un recuerdo\npara Kari."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Oh? You really do care about your\nsister.",
      "speaker_id": 6101,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10194,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "Ah, ¿sí? Sí que quieres a tu\nhermana."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "T-Tai?",
      "speaker_id": 6101,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10236,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¿T-Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Moooooooooooom!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10246,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Mamáaaaaaaaaa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "W-what's this all of a sudden?",
      "speaker_id": 6101,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10262,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¿Q-qué pasa tan de repente?"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "What's wrong?",
      "speaker_id": 6091,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10293,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¿Qué pasa?"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Daaaaaaaaaaaaaad!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10307,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Papáaaaaaaaaaa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Why were you crying just now?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10325,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¿Por qué llorabas ahora?"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Don't ask me that!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10355,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡No preguntes eso!"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10374,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Kari...!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10382,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Kari...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Tai... did you finish what you\nhad to do?",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10393,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Tai... ¿terminaste lo que\ntenías que hacer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "No, there's still more to be done.\nAnyway, Kari, about the incident \nat Karigaoka four years ago...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10438,
      "_bytes": 103,
      "translation": "No, todavía queda trabajo.\nOye, Kari, sobre lo que pasó\nen Hikarioka hace cuatro años..."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Do you still remember it?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10542,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¿Todavía te acuerdas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Koromon got big and fought with a\nhuge bird, right?",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10568,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "Koromon creció y luchó contra\nun pájaro enorme, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10620,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "Sí."
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Did you forget, Tai?",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10626,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Lo olvidaste, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Y-yeah...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10650,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "S-sí..."
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Hey, Kari. Do you have a\nDigivice, by any chance?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10660,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "Oye, Kari. ¿No tendrás un\nDigivice, por casualidad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "A Digivice?",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10712,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¿Un Digivice?"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "A Digivice?",
      "speaker_id": 8011,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 10724,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¿Digivice?"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Like this.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10736,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "Como esto."
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "I don't have one.",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10747,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "No tengo ninguno."
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "You don't... yeah, of course you\ndon't.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10765,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "No tienes... ya, claro que\nno tienes."
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Tai, I'm sleepy...",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10805,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Tai, tengo sueño..."
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Yeah, why don't we get some sleep?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10827,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Ya, ¿por qué no dormimos ya?"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "By the way, Tai, have you seen\nMiko?",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10862,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "Por cierto, Tai, ¿has visto\na Miko?"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "I haven't. Wasn't Miko playing\noutside?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10902,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "No. ¿No estaba Miko jugando\nfuera?"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Miko? What's Miko?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10942,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¿Miko? ¿Qué es Miko?"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Our cat.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10961,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "La gata."
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Cat? What's a cat?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10970,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¿Gata? ¿Qué es eso?"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "I'll show you sometime. Come on,\nlet's go to bed.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 10989,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "Ya te la enseñaré. Venga,\na dormir."
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "I wonder where Miko went...",
      "speaker_id": 1081,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 11039,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¿Dónde estará Miko...?"
    }
  ]
}